{"4541920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GRIDLANDS", "steam_appid": 4541920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5114770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/c69ac2cacb3fcb7a2e09f57027798be6.avif?t=1787297806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras_big/c69ac2cacb3fcb7a2e09f57027798be6.webp?t=1787297806 width=1560 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/829e4359b31692b295834b0b60eb4028.poster.avif?t=1787297806\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/829e4359b31692b295834b0b60eb4028.webm?t=1787297806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/829e4359b31692b295834b0b60eb4028.mp4?t=1787297806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter abandoned combat zones where THE GRID controls everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge valuable tech, fight relentless machines, and push deeper for better loot while your signal fades and extraction becomes harder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a gamble. Every mistake can cost your gear. Get in, survive the hunt, and make it out before there is no way back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/5f290af7a29b54b53cc818c623767d7c.avif?t=1787297806\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/e1b22de050c286140f6bb71ac8ec7683.avif?t=1787297806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras_big/e1b22de050c286140f6bb71ac8ec7683.webp?t=1787297806 width=1560 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/9c333c4503c852caaeef4c037e207eed.poster.avif?t=1787297806\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/9c333c4503c852caaeef4c037e207eed.webm?t=1787297806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/9c333c4503c852caaeef4c037e207eed.mp4?t=1787297806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your crafted drone, scan hostile ground, and find your route before stepping into the Grid. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach abandoned zones, track movement from above, and push deeper as your signal starts to break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second inside makes extraction harder. Every room can lead to better loot, hidden tech, or another dead end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the zone. Follow the signal. Extract before THE GRID cuts you off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/5f290af7a29b54b53cc818c623767d7c.avif?t=1787297806\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541920/extras/536e287486a440d359194bdd1fac9f0b.avif?t=1787297806\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass